{
  "title": "Nutty Flaky Filipino Malai Paella",
  "description": "This Filipino dish features malai, render-fat, and low-glycemic-friendly ingredients, making it a unique and energizing meal option. It combines herbal flavors with flaky texture and nutty taste.",
  "cuisine": "Filipino",
  "diet": [
    "low-glycemic",
